GTA Clip Studio - third-party notices for source code
=====================================================

clipstudio/moments.py adapts several GTA event phrase patterns (chase, crash, stunt, combat, NPC
chaos, mission, reaction) and the idea of not counting plans, "what if" talk and retold stories
as events from:

  Grand Theft Auto 6 Clips Kitty Plugin
  https://github.com/ColinGPT9/Grand-Theft-Auto-6-Clips-Kitty-Plugin (commit 1677a70)

